    "title": "Nakobe Dean quickly becomes defensive focal point for Raiders - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Get More Sports ,\n21 hours ago Nakobe Dean provided a clear example of his impact in Las Vegas on a fourth-quarter third-and-2 in the Raiders’ Week 2 win over the Chargers, when he shifted from the B-gap to the A-gap and stopped running back Omarion Hampton for no gain, forcing a punt, according to ESPN. Read full article",
